  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study Greening the Maritime Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the upcoming years, the Government of Bangladesh intends to increase investments in the maritime sector and develop its Blue Economy in a green and sustainable manner. This creates trade and investment opportunities for the Dutch Delta Technology and Maritime industry. The purpose of this project is to identify these opportunities for Dutch companies, specifically small and medium enterprises, and stimulate investment and collaboration. It aims to support Bangladesh&#x2019;s green transition of its maritime sector while fostering increased trade and investment between the Netherlands and Bangladesh in a sustainable and responsible manner.</narrative>
  </description>
